  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "專業實務職場體驗實習",
    "sub_ename": "PROFESSIONAL PRACTICE AND WORKPLACE EXPERIENCE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在使學生能夠實地瞭解都市計畫及相關產業脈動，並配合未來的就業，在320小時的職場實習中，將所學在工作職場實際結合，靈活運用所學知識於實務問題之操作，強化專業倫理與提昇未來就業之競爭力。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course is intended to train students how to practice urban planning on site in the workplace.  A 320-hour internship direct in the workplace is designed to intensify students’ professional ethics, enhance planning skills, and promote their competitiveness in the market.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
